# Who may read and write which MQTT topics. Only usernames live here, no
# passwords. Anything not listed is denied.

# Frigate is the only client allowed to publish detections, so nobody else on
# the network can fake an event (for example a "known face" to silence alerts).
user frigate
topic readwrite frigate/#

# Home Assistant reads Frigate, switches Frigate features on and off, and
# handles MQTT discovery for sensors.
user homeassistant
topic readwrite #

# The control app only listens.
user homecontrol
topic read frigate/events

# ESP32 / Wi-Fi sensing nodes, if they use MQTT. Give each node this account
# (or one each) and keep them on the IoT network.
user sensors
topic readwrite sensors/#
topic write homeassistant/#
